6.3 Referential Integrity
Every evidence.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every model.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every uncertainty_source.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every revision.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every attribution_relation.attribution_id and attribution_relation.related_attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every work_link.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every full_pipeline_link.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every null_model_link.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every verification_link.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every provenance.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

Every moderation.attribution_id must exist in climate_attribution.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The attribution relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

