12. Validation Engine Design
The registry validates the following.

Validation 1. Attribution validity. Every attribution is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Work resolution.

Validation 5. Full-pipeline result resolution.

Validation 6. Null-model result resolution.

Validation 7. Verification result resolution.

Validation 8. Provenance completeness.

Validation 9. Audit completeness.

Validation 10. Moderation completeness.

Validation 11. Confidence consistency. The confidence level must be consistent with the uncertainty.

Validation 12. Contribution consistency. The contribution estimate must be consistent with the evidence.

Validation 13. Counterfactual consistency. The counterfactual baseline must be consistent with the attributed cause.

Validation 14. Method consistency. The attribution method must be consistent with the event type.

